versus additive would oppose only the tested residual interaction.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:EST\", \"paper:est\"], \"executed_refs\": [], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-ultrahstu\", \"decision\": \"considered\", \"rationale\": \"Context/gating search hit; benchmark section 2.3 read. There is no local evidence for changing sequence transduction or sparsity in this question.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"No new module adopted from this card; the intervention is locally motivated bounded context/history hidden interaction with additive and count/fixed controls.\", \"variant_names\": [], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"A hidden feature product does not reproduce HSTU gating, hybrid attention, active-sequence changes or an UltraHSTU layer.\", \"falsifier\": \"These four residual arms cannot support or refute the external full method. Its transfer would require its own authorized parameter/cost-matched replacement. Failure of cross versus additive would oppose only the tested residual interaction.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:UltraHSTU\", \"paper:ultrahstu\"], \"executed_refs\": [], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-unimixer\", \"decision\": \"considered\", \"rationale\": \"Context/gating search hit; benchmark section 2.3 read. Flattening the entire padded history would replace the compression boundary and add a separate capacity/cost question.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"No new module adopted from this card; the intervention is locally motivated bounded context/history hidden interaction with additive and count/fixed controls.\", \"variant_names\": \n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
